# Build context for gengo-web.Dockerfile only (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore beside the Dockerfile in place of a root
# .dockerignore). The context is the whole bennetto-infra repo, so allow only
# what the image needs: then a change to gengo's README, backlog, tests or the
# other sites leaves the image unchanged and gengo-web keeps running. See
# INFRA-2.
*
!gengo/requirements.txt
!gengo/gengo/
gengo/gengo/test/
**/__pycache__
